  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "测试之前，先要写清楚测什么。",
   "spoken": "测试之前，先要写清楚测什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "规格里，写出每个函数调用前要满足什么，调用后保证什么。",
   "spoken": "规格里，写出每个函数掉用前要满足什么，掉用后保证什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 9.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "再写出系统的不变量，也就是任何时候都必须成立的性质。",
   "spoken": "再写出系统的不变量，也就是任何时候都必须成立的性质。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.064,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 11.162,
   "speechEnd": 15.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "还要列出每个特权角色，最多能造成多大破坏。",
   "spoken": "还要列出每个特权决色，最多能造成多大破坏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.54,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 16.638,
   "speechEnd": 20.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "有了这些，测试分三层。",
   "spoken": "有了这些，测试分三层。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.152,
   "dur": 2.904,
   "speechStart": 21.25,
   "speechEnd": 23.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第一层，单元测试，验证你想到的情况。",
   "spoken": "第一层，单元测试，验证你想到的情况。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.276,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 24.374,
   "speechEnd": 27.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "第二层，模糊测试，让工具生成大量随机输入。",
   "spoken": "第二层，模糊测试，让工具生成大量随机输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.576,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 28.674,
   "speechEnd": 32.662
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "比如一个金库，存进去，马上取出来，用户不能多拿。",
   "spoken": "比如一个金库，存进去，马上取出来，用户不能多拿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.716,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 33.814,
   "speechEnd": 38.361
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "工具会换着各种随机金额，一遍遍去试。",
   "spoken": "工具会换着各种随机金额，一遍遍去试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.408,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 39.506,
   "speechEnd": 42.458
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "只要有一个金额，让取回的比存入的多，测试就失败。",
   "spoken": "只要有一个金额，让取回的比存入的多，测试就失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.516,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 43.614,
   "speechEnd": 47.578
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "这条性质背后的规则是，舍入必须偏向金库。",
   "spoken": "这条性质背后的规则是，舍入必须偏向金库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.632,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 48.73,
   "speechEnd": 52.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "第三层，不变量测试，随机的不是参数，是调用的顺序。",
   "spoken": "第三层，不变量测试，随机的不是参数，是掉用的顺序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 53.292,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 53.39,
   "speechEnd": 57.854
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "比如一个银行合约，存款、取款、转账，被随机组合着连续调用。",
   "spoken": "比如一个银航合约，存款、取款、转账，被随机组合着连续掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 58.912,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 59.01,
   "speechEnd": 64.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "每一步之后都检查一次，银行的余额，不少于所有存款加起来。",
   "spoken": "每一步之后都检查一次，银航的余额，不少于所有存款加起来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 65.684,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 65.782,
   "speechEnd": 70.401
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.448,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 71.546,
   "speechEnd": 72.7
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "一个重入漏洞，要先调用存款，再在回调里调用转账，才会触发。",
   "spoken": "一个虫入漏洞，要先掉用存款，再在回掉里掉用转账，才会触发。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 73.756,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 73.854,
   "speechEnd": 79.092
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "只随机参数的模糊测试，能发现它吗？",
   "spoken": "只随机参数的模糊测试，能发现它吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 80.144,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 80.242,
   "speechEnd": 83.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "通常不能，因为它不会打乱调用顺序。",
   "spoken": "通常不能，因为它不会打乱掉用顺序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 84.868,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 84.966,
   "speechEnd": 87.656
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "不变量测试生成随机调用序列，再配上能触发回调的封装合约，才有机会发现。",
   "spoken": "不变量测试生成随机掉用序列，再配上能触发回掉的封装合约，才有机会发现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.712,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 88.81,
   "speechEnd": 94.583
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "但要注意，不变量测试只检查你写下的不变量。",
   "spoken": "但要注意，不变量测试只检查你写下的不变量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 95.652,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 95.75,
   "speechEnd": 99.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "Euler 事故里那一条，每个账户健康因子不低于 1，或者能被清算，而且清算后协议不亏。",
   "spoken": "Euler 事故里那一条，每个账户健康因子不低于 1，或者能被清算，而且清算后协议不亏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.6,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 100.698,
   "speechEnd": 107.198
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "如果它没写进测试，工具也不会发现。",
   "spoken": "如果它没写进测试，工具也不会发现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 108.236,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 108.334,
   "speechEnd": 111.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "核心数学库、清算逻辑、跨链桥的证明验证，还可以再做形式化验证。",
   "spoken": "核心数学库、清算逻辑、跨链桥的证明验证，还可以再做形式化验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 112.536,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 112.634,
   "speechEnd": 118.586
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "它用数学方法证明，代码在所有输入和状态下都满足规格。",
   "spoken": "它用数学方法证明，代码在所有输入和状态下都满足规格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 119.644,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 119.742,
   "speechEnd": 124.468
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
